==Battleground==
*1 [[Zangief (Enemy)|Zangief]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Ken (Enemy)|Ken]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*5 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ryu (Enemy)|Ryu]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Kory|Kories]] spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage can be difficult for early players, especially on higher crown difficulties. Make sure you don't hit the base too early so as not to unleash both Ryu and Kory along with everything else in the stage. [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cats]] are recommended here as both peons, as well as Zangief and Ken, are all Red. Other generalist units like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] are also useful here.

